Package: ora
Type: Package
Title: Oracle Space and Privilege Helpers
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Florian", "Schwendinger",
           email = "florian.schwendinger@quintik-tech.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Read-only helpers to see how full an Oracle 19c database is,
    where the space goes and which privileges the connecting user has.
    Maintenance statements are only generated as SQL text.
